data: {"id":"chatcmpl-01da08e8-1ab6-4371-ad44-742764e18821","object":"chat.completion.chunk","created":1795549634,"model":"gemini-4-carbon","choices":[{"index":0,"delta":{"reasoning_content":"Checking each record type's behavior after basic field validations. For `BEGIN` records (Type 1), the focus is the order of R17 (DUPLICATE_TXN) and R18 (TOO_MANY_OPEN) checks, with R17 preceding R18 to avoid adding a duplicate transaction ID to the `seenTxns` set if the subsequent check throws the exception. The `seenTxns.add(rawTxn)` is performed only if no exception is thrown during recovery.\n\n\n"},"finish_reason":null}],"usage":null}

data: {"id":"chatcmpl-01da08e8-1ab6-4371-ad44-742764e18821","object":"chat.completion.chunk","created":1795549634,"model":"gemini-4-carbon","choices":[{"index":0,"delta":{"reasoning_content":"Initializes a new transaction from the pool with the `BEGIN` record. The sorted `openTxns` array maintains transaction ID order, increments `openCount`. Validates `PUT` record fields. Transaction check confirms the transaction is open and doesn't exceed its write limit before updating the write list. The key and value strings are constructed and added to the transaction's write list.\n\n\n"},"finish_reason":null}],"usage":null}

data: {"id":"chatcmpl-01da08e8-1ab6-4371-ad44-742764e18821","object":"chat.completion.chunk","created":1795549634,"model":"gemini-4-carbon","choices":[{"index":0,"delta":{"reasoning_content":"#### DELETE Record Validation and Processing\n\nThe process confirms the integrity and correctness of the DELETE record, verifying all applicable R-rules (R13, R14, R15) and transaction checks. R19 (TXN_NOT_OPEN) is enforced, raising an exception if the transaction is not open. R19a (TXN_TOO_LARGE) checks are performed, signaling an error if the transaction write limit is exceeded. The key string is then constructed and added to the transaction's write list, using `null` to mark the operation as a DELETE.\n\n#### COMMIT Record Validation and Processing\n\nCOMMIT record processing ensures compliance with R13 and R14. Checks include validation of transaction status (R19 - TXN_NOT_OPEN). The transaction is removed from the open transactions list. Conflict detection is activated using `globalCommitSeq` and `t.beginCommitSeq`.\n\n\n"},"finish_reason":null}],"usage":null}

